* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
mvnw text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# B7: the Maven wrapper shell script parses maven-wrapper.properties with a plain
# `read`/`case` loop. A UTF-8 BOM becomes part of the first key, so `distributionUrl`
# is never matched and ./mvnw dies with "cannot read distributionUrl property" — which
# takes CI down before a single test runs. LF, no BOM, always.
*.properties text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary